WEBVTT

00:00.350 --> 00:01.262
Every morning,

00:01.262 --> 00:02.530
your front desk starts

00:02.530 --> 00:03.940
the same race.

00:04.495 --> 00:06.335
Is this patient active?

00:06.335 --> 00:07.695
Has the frequency been

00:07.695 --> 00:08.607
used?

00:08.607 --> 00:09.455
What will the plan

00:09.455 --> 00:10.965
actually pay?

00:11.272 --> 00:14.030
Meet EDiFi Eligibility!

00:14.470 --> 00:15.931
EDiFi connects to your

00:15.931 --> 00:17.343
Open Dental schedule,

00:17.343 --> 00:18.571
and checks every patient's

00:18.571 --> 00:20.713
insurance before they arrive.

00:21.330 --> 00:22.649
Your whole day,

00:22.649 --> 00:24.466
verified in one view.

00:24.466 --> 00:25.671
With a clear status

00:25.671 --> 00:27.168
on every appointment.

00:28.493 --> 00:30.189
Open any patient and

00:30.189 --> 00:31.679
see the real picture.

00:31.679 --> 00:32.726
Maximums,

00:32.726 --> 00:33.809
deductibles,

00:33.809 --> 00:34.971
and what each category

00:34.971 --> 00:36.419
actually pays.

00:36.868 --> 00:37.888
And it runs your

00:37.888 --> 00:39.048
whole week from one

00:39.048 --> 00:39.788
screen.

00:39.788 --> 00:40.552
Day,

00:40.552 --> 00:40.928
week,

00:40.928 --> 00:42.632
and three day views,

00:42.632 --> 00:43.979
plus confirmations,

00:43.979 --> 00:44.588
production,

00:44.588 --> 00:45.408
and alerts,

00:45.408 --> 00:46.998
right beside the schedule.

00:47.456 --> 00:48.860
But here's what changes

00:48.860 --> 00:49.726
everything.

00:50.406 --> 00:51.459
First,

00:51.459 --> 00:52.734
EDiFi flags what needs

00:52.734 --> 00:53.506
attention,

00:53.506 --> 00:54.179
and shows you the

00:54.179 --> 00:56.076
proof behind every answer.

00:56.526 --> 00:57.673
Second,

00:57.673 --> 00:59.315
every number shows its

00:59.315 --> 00:59.846
source.

00:59.846 --> 01:00.816
And when something is

01:00.816 --> 01:01.433
missing?

01:01.433 --> 01:02.926
EDiFi doesn't guess.

01:02.926 --> 01:04.339
It goes and finds

01:04.339 --> 01:04.739
it.

01:04.739 --> 01:06.233
In Open Dental,

01:06.233 --> 01:07.379
on the payer portal,

01:07.379 --> 01:08.350
or with a phone

01:08.350 --> 01:09.036
call.

01:09.250 --> 01:10.530
Third,

01:10.530 --> 01:12.196
it goes past active.

01:12.196 --> 01:13.528
Frequencies,

01:13.528 --> 01:14.443
waiting periods,

01:14.443 --> 01:15.823
and plan rules,

01:15.823 --> 01:16.956
all before the patient

01:16.956 --> 01:18.173
is in the chair.

01:18.616 --> 01:20.280
Your office manager,

01:20.280 --> 01:21.328
your hygienists,

01:21.328 --> 01:22.528
and your doctors.

01:22.528 --> 01:23.688
All working from the

01:23.688 --> 01:25.518
same verified picture.

01:25.921 --> 01:27.780
EDiFi Eligibility.

01:27.780 --> 01:29.766
Verify every patient before

01:29.766 --> 01:30.694
they arrive.

01:30.694 --> 01:34.084
See it at elitedentalforce.com
